          "ingredients": "Bone-in chicken thighs and drumsticks (preferred over breast for flavor and the collagen that bones contribute). Massaman paste. Full-fat coconut milk. Chicken stock. Potatoes. Pearl onions. Whole roasted peanuts. Fish sauce, palm sugar, tamarind juice.",
