          "culture": "Larb Gai is the most family-friendly and accessible version of the dish — its lighter flavor and less challenging character making it appropriate for children and adults alike. In Thai home cooking, it is frequently prepared for family dinners and represents the Isan flavor tradition at its most approachable.",
